      "cause_hint": "popsim_mid does not rake the nine-category composition; only the ticket GROUP totals are controlled per Kreis (blended MiD x SrV target). Within-group composition is steered only where a group control pins it (never_pt since issue #329); 'no_answer' is excluded from scoring (structurally unproducible). NOTE the two tables are not the same reference: the control is steered toward the blended MiD x SrV target (target2026_pt_ticket_group4_by_kreis.csv, 03101 never_pt 12.32%) while this metric scores against renormalized MiD P24.1 alone (03101 never_pt 14.00%), so a residual delta of roughly that 1.7pp gap on never_pt is EXPECTED by construction -- it is neither an error nor drift, but the distance between the blend and its MiD half (ADR-0099)."
